Cmn1=Edit Item Device - Tony Caraffa\\\\*Intended for use with Edit Item||1
Cmn2=Interface Module\\\\This device module allows the user to dynamically||1
Cmn3=edit text and store the values in a file.\\\\-InUse - To facilitate||1
Cmn4=refresh text across a source crosspoint.  Use a 1 if not no crosspoint||1
Cmn5=is used.\\-Item Value - Index value of item to edit.\\-Item Seed||1
Cmn6=xsig - connect to xsig to intake seed values if you want to set||1
Cmn7=them dynamically. \\After attempt to init file, waits 30s for xsig||1
Cmn8=then proceeds to seed with prefix paramter.\\\\-Request Seed values||1
Cmn9=- If no file exists (first program load), this signal will be set||1
Cmn10=for 30s to request seed value from an xsig.\\It wil go low when||1
Cmn11=xsig is received.  If no xsig is recieved the prefix paramter will||1
Cmn12=be used to initialize the file.\\-Item * Name$ - Dynamic text to||1
Cmn13=appear on touch panel.\\\\-File Name - Name of file.  ".dat" will||1
Cmn14=be appended automatically.\\-Crosspoing - First 3 digits of crosspoing||1
Cmn15=to be used.  99 corrspoints will be automatically added.\\-Seed||1
Cmn16=Prefix - Used to seed file intilization if xsig not used.  Will||1
Cmn17=be appended with serial text "1" to "99"\\\\v1_1 - Added xpt connect||1
Cmn18=from Interface, and Selected Item Serial.\\\\\\\\\\
